following two lower-bounds on $\|XX^{T}-ZZ^{T}\|_{F}^{2}=\|\e\|^{2}$:\begin{subequations}\label{eq:key-claim}
\begin{gather}
s_{r}\one^{T}d\le\|d\|^{2}\quad\implies\quad\|\e\|^{2}\ge s_{r}^{2}\frac{(\one^{T}d)^{2}}{\|d\|^{2}}+(r-p)s_{r}^{2}+\|d\|^{2},\label{eq:key-claim1}\\
s_{r}\one^{T}d\ge\|d\|^{2}\quad\implies\quad\|\e\|^{2}\ge2s_{r}\one^{T}d-\|d\|^{2}+(r-p)s_{r}^{2}+\|d\|^{2}.\label{eq:key-claim2}
