\end{subequations}Substituting $s_{r}=\beta\cdot\|\e\|\|d\|/(\one^{T}d)$
yields
\[
(r-p)s_{r}^{2}=(r-p)\frac{\|d\|^{2}}{(\one^{T}d)^{2}}\beta^{2}\|\e\|^{2}\ge(r-p)\frac{1}{\nnz(d)}\beta^{2}\|\e\|^{2}\ge\frac{(r-p)}{p}\beta^{2}\|\e\|^{2},
